Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 11:59:34 +0545
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] context: hand-off mode starts the user session on a free
 VT in graphics mode and retires the greeter after the switch

---
 greetd/src/config/mod.rs | 14 +++++++++
 greetd/src/context.rs    | 63 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 greetd/src/server.rs     |  1 +
 3 files changed, 77 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/greetd/src/config/mod.rs b/greetd/src/config/mod.rs
